{
  "$schema": "./services.schema.json",
  "services": [
    {
      "id": "backend",
      "kind": "editor",
      "owner_repo": "editor",
      "lifecycle": "persistent",
      "management": "editor-session",
      "host_env": null,
      "port": 18449,
      "health_url": "{base}/api/v1/platform/health",
      "card_url": null,
      "start": { "cwd": "editor", "cmd": ["python", "-m", "uvicorn", "backend.app.main:app", "--host", "127.0.0.1", "--port", "{port}"], "env_file": ".superpowers/sdd/editor-law.env" },
      "depends_on": ["pascalMcp"],
      "version_source": "git:editor",
      "notes": "FastAPI domain owner. Agents reach it as EDITOR_DOMAIN_URL (their env, not the host's). product.mjs probes /openapi.json in product mode and this health route in native mode. Kept alive by infra/host (`bun run host:start`); `python` resolves to editor/.venv there, and env_file is the gitignored local binding file backend/memory/05-run-and-test.md starts it with."
    },
    {
      "id": "editor",
      "kind": "editor",
      "owner_repo": "editor",
      "lifecycle": "session",
      "management": "editor-session",
      "host_env": null,
      "port": 3003,
      "health_url": "{base}/api/health",
      "card_url": null,
      "start": { "cwd": "editor", "cmd": ["bun", "run", "dev", "--filter", "editor", "--", "--hostname", "127.0.0.1", "--port", "{port}"] },
      "depends_on": [],
      "version_source": "git:editor",
      "notes": "Next app frontend/app/editor, started through turbo (workspace packages first) on Next 16's default Turbopack (2026-10-13: the dwg workspace files the editor reaches import by their real .ts/.tsx extension, so Webpack's extensionAlias is no longer needed; first page compiles fell from up to 40 s to under 10 s). Mounted under /editor behind the PLAN frontend in product mode (infra/dev/runtime.mjs, same command); the public app itself in native mode. EDITOR_PUBLIC_URL in the backend's env file must name this port, or the browser's POST doors answer 403."
    },
    {
      "id": "frontend",
      "kind": "editor",
      "owner_repo": "editor",
      "lifecycle": "session",
      "management": "editor-session",
      "host_env": null,
      "port": 5173,
      "health_url": "{base}/api/drawing",
      "card_url": null,
      "start": { "cwd": "editor/frontend/app/planm", "cmd": ["npm", "run", "dev", "--", "--host", "127.0.0.1", "--port", "{port}"] },
      "depends_on": ["backend"],
      "version_source": "git:editor",
      "notes": "Vite PLAN shell (frontend/app/planm); product mode only."
    },
    {
      "id": "dwg",
      "kind": "editor",
      "owner_repo": "editor",
      "lifecycle": "persistent",
      "management": "editor-session",
      "host_env": null,
      "port": 4317,
      "health_url": "{base}/api/health",
      "card_url": null,
      "start": { "cwd": "editor/infra/services/dwg", "cmd": ["npm", "run", "gateway"] },
      "depends_on": [],
      "version_source": "git:editor",
      "notes": "DWG provider gateway; product mode only."
    },
    {
      "id": "pascalMcp",
      "kind": "editor",
      "owner_repo": "editor",
      "lifecycle": "persistent",
      "management": "editor-session",
      "host_env": null,
      "port": 3917,
      "health_url": "{base}/health",
      "card_url": null,
      "start": { "cwd": "editor", "cmd": ["bun", "run", "backend/mcp/src/bin/pascal-mcp.ts", "--http", "--port", "{port}"] },
      "depends_on": [],
      "version_source": "git:editor",
      "notes": "Pascal MCP bridge; the backend publishes through it (PASCAL_MCP_URL = {base}/mcp)."
    },
    {
      "id": "orchestrator",
      "capabilities": ["design-conversation/v1"],
      "required_for_capabilities": ["design-conversation/v1"],
      "kind": "orchestrator",
      "owner_repo": "agents/OrchestratorAgent",
      "lifecycle": "persistent",
      "management": "agent-host",
      "host_env": "EDITOR_ORCHESTRATOR_URL",
      "port": 8791,
      "health_url": "{base}/editor/v1/health",
      "card_url": null,
      "start": { "cwd": "agents/OrchestratorAgent", "cmd": [".venv-orchestrator/Scripts/python.exe", "-X", "utf8", "-m", "orchestrator.editor_api", "--port", "{port}", "--enable-submissions"] },
      "depends_on": [],
      "version_source": "health:version",
      "notes": "Orchestrator editor API (orchestrator/editor_api.py, default port in its argparse). Since 2026-10-09 the door carries its own worker thread (`--enable-submissions` starts worker.standby; health says worker: running), so no separate worker entry or hand-started `-m orchestrator worker` is needed — a second worker only waits for worker.lock. The old stack.ps1 worker has no port. Bearer A2A_TOKEN. Run submissions need --enable-submissions (runtime/orchestrator/design.sqlite must exist). Whole stack: Docker Desktop, then scripts/services/stack.ps1 -Action start (ops/db + ops compose, dependencies.ps1, mass-export.ps1, a2a.ps1 = 15 agents, worker); dependencies.ps1 still copies from the retired AG-light path and fails non-fatally (2026-10-08)."
    },
    {
      "id": "law",
      "kind": "agent",
      "idle_timeout_s": null,
      "memory_mb": 90,
      "owner_repo": "agents/Lawagent",
      "lifecycle": "persistent",
      "management": "external",
      "compose": { "project": "ops", "service": "law" },
      "host_env": "LAW_A2A_URL",
      "port": 8301,
      "health_url": "{base}/health",
      "card_url": "{base}/.well-known/agent-card.json",
      "start": { "cwd": "agents/Lawagent", "cmd": ["bash", "scripts/serve-a2a.sh"], "env_file": "config/lawagent.env" },
      "launcher": { "directory": "Lawagent", "catalog": "law_agent.json", "name": "LawAgent", "skill": "law_health" },
      "depends_on": ["neo4j"],
      "version_source": "card:version",
      "notes": "Served by the ops compose service `law` (ace-law-1, 2026-10-09): the host activates it with `docker compose up -d` (idempotent), never spawns `start` (that mirrors a2a.ps1, which also skips it while a card answers), never adopts or kills it, no idle stop. Port is LAW_A2A_PORT in config/lawagent.env (the serve script sources it)."
    },
    {
      "id": "masterplan",
      "capabilities": ["design-conversation/v1"],
      "kind": "agent",
      "idle_timeout_s": 1800,
      "memory_mb": 90,
